desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Dangerous Syscall"
	title_zh: "Dangerous Syscall"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-dangerous-syscall"
	risk: "unsafe-implementation"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
'syscall' is essentially unsafe and unportable. The DL (https://apidock.com/ruby/Fiddle) library is preferred for safer and a bit more portable programming.

### 风险类型
不安全实现（unsafe-implementation）

### 影响
使用了不安全或不稳定的底层调用，可能引入内存安全或逻辑风险。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-94: Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用受控的安全 API，并补充必要的边界检查。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.rb": <<<POS
syscall
POS
	"safefile://pos.rb": <<<NEG
Fiddle::Function
NEG
)

${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/(?:syscall)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Dangerous Syscall",
	title_zh: "Dangerous Syscall",
	message: "Dangerous Syscall detected.",
}
